'' ===========================================================================
''
''   File.......  ch02-term-print-value.spin2
''   Purpose....  Printing a live value rather than a message, so the
''                window becomes a readout
''   Manual.....  P2 Debug Window Manual
''   Version....  v1.1.3 (2026-08-18)
''   Appears in.  Chapter 2: Getting Started -- Your first window
''   Authors....  Iron Sheep Productions, LLC
''   E-mail.....  stephen@ironsheep.biz
''   Started....  Jun 2026
''   Updated....  Jun 2026
''
''   This file is an EXAMPLE from the manual above. Everything below
''   this header is byte-identical to the listing printed there --
''   what you read in the manual is what builds here.
''
'' ===========================================================================

CON _clkfreq = 200_000_000

PUB main() | reading
  debug(`TERM Status SIZE 30 5)  ' create a 30x5 text window named "Status"
  reading := 42
  debug(`Status 'Reading: `(reading)' 13)   ' feed it by name
  repeat                                          ' keep the window open

